+
+<BR>
+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Called when we have decided that the result of
+ using a connection should be interpreted as a
+ backoff signal.</TD>
+</TR>
