+
+<BR>
+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Called when we have determined that the result of
+ using a connection has succeeded and that we may
+ probe for more connections.</TD>
