+<B>Method Summary</B></FONT></TH>
+</TR>
+<TR BGCOLOR="white" CLASS="TableRowColor">
+<TD ALIGN="right" VALIGN="top" WIDTH="1%"><FONT SIZE="-1">
+<CODE>&nbsp;boolean</CODE></FONT></TD>
+<TD><CODE><B><A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/client/ConnectionBackoffStrategy.html#shouldBackoff(org.apache.http.HttpResponse)">shouldBackoff</A></B>(<A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpResponse.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http">HttpResponse</A>&nbsp;resp)</CODE>
+
+<BR>
+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Determines whether receiving the given <A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpResponse.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http"><CODE>HttpResponse</CODE></A> as
+ a result of request execution should result in a backoff
+ signal.</TD>
+</TR>
+<TR BGCOLOR="white" CLASS="TableRowColor">
+<TD ALIGN="right" VALIGN="top" WIDTH="1%"><FONT SIZE="-1">
+<CODE>&nbsp;boolean</CODE></FONT></TD>
+<TD><CODE><B><A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/client/ConnectionBackoffStrategy.html#shouldBackoff(java.lang.Throwable)">shouldBackoff</A></B>(<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Throwable.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">Throwable</A>&nbsp;t)</CODE>
+
+<BR>
+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Determines whether seeing the given <code>Throwable</code> as
+ a result of request execution should result in a backoff
+ signal.</TD>
+</TR>
+</TABLE>
+&nbsp;
+<P>
+
