+<BR>
+Interface ServiceUnavailableRetryStrategy</H2>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Known Implementing Classes:</B> <DD><A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/impl/client/DefaultServiceUnavailableRetryStrategy.html" title="class in org.apache.http.impl.client">DefaultServiceUnavailableRetryStrategy</A></DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>ServiceUnavailableRetryStrategy</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+Strategy interface that allows API users to plug in their own logic to
+ control whether or not a retry should automatically be done, how many times
+ it should be retried and so on.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.2</DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
+
+<P>
