+retryRequest</H3>
+<PRE>
+boolean <B>retryRequest</B>(<A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpResponse.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http">HttpResponse</A>&nbsp;response,
+                     int&nbsp;executionCount,
