+<H2>
+<FONT SIZE="-1">
+org.apache.http.client.cache</FONT>
+<BR>
+Interface HttpCacheUpdateCallback</H2>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>HttpCacheUpdateCallback</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+Used for atomically updating entries in a <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/cache/HttpCacheStorage.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client.cache"><CODE>HttpCacheStorage</CODE></A>
+ implementation. The current entry (if any) is fed into an implementation
+ of this interface, and the new, possibly updated entry (if any)
+ should be returned.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<HR>
+
+<P>
+
