+generate</H3>
+<PRE>
+<A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/cache/Resource.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client.cache">Resource</A> <B>generate</B>(<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">String</A>&nbsp;requestId,
+                  <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/io/InputStream.html" title="class or interface in java.io">InputStream</A>&nbsp;instream,
+                  <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/cache/InputLimit.html" title="class in org.apache.http.client.cache">InputLimit</A>&nbsp;limit)
+                  throws <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/io/IOException.html" title="class or interface in java.io">IOException</A></PRE>
+<DL>
+<DD>Creates a <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/cache/Resource.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client.cache"><CODE>Resource</CODE></A> from a given response body.
+<P>
+<DD><DL>
+<DT><B>Parameters:</B><DD><CODE>requestId</CODE> - a unique identifier for this particular
+   response body<DD><CODE>instream</CODE> - the original <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/io/InputStream.html" title="class or interface in java.io"><CODE>InputStream</CODE></A>
+   containing the response body of the origin HTTP response.<DD><CODE>limit</CODE> - maximum number of bytes to consume of the
+   response body; if this limit is reached before the
+   response body is fully consumed, mark the limit has
+   having been reached and return a <code>Resource</code>
+   containing the data read to that point.
+<DT><B>Returns:</B><DD>a <code>Resource</code> containing however much of
+   the response body was successfully read.
+<DT><B>Throws:</B>
+<DD><CODE><A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/io/IOException.html" title="class or interface in java.io">IOException</A></CODE></DL>
+</DD>
+</DL>
